ding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/3/3b/ofufd5ijubib19ho57118j3jvnv9msi.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E9%A3%8E%E8%B5%B7%E6%B5%AA%E6%B6%8C.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/3/3b/ofufd5ijubib19ho57118j3jvnv9msi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />风起浪涌\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（领袖光环）场上所有阵营为&lt;锐疾如风&gt;的己方，攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">10%</font>，防御提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。主动攻击、释放[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">支援</span>]或[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]技能时，若敌人拥有<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>个及以上[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，则自身攻击提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">18%</font>；并获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"运筹帷幄\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">运筹帷幄</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%B2%81%E7%89%B9%E8%8F%B2\" title=\"角色图鉴库/鲁特菲\"><img alt=\"头像 鲁特菲.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/04/t7nxot7sbb67xzv5iglsou2wsfagduk.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" he